# include-into-split shared
library "Shared".

// Multi-layer: a terminology (Concepts) AND a coded-from concept (Asserted),
// so emit auto-splits "Shared" into policy-id-named layer libraries. No
// "Shared.cql" exists after the split.
terminology "Shared Vs":
- valueset is `shared-vs`.

concept "Shared Leaf":
- type is Observation.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- coded from "Shared Vs".
